# AI Service

This service provides the AI features for the **PDF_AI** project.

## Completed Features

* PDF Parser
* Text Cleaning
* Text Chunking
* Embedding Generation
* ChromaDB Vector Storage
* Chat with PDF (RAG)
* Grammar & Spell Checker
* AI Summary
* AI Translation
* OCR (Images & Scanned PDFs)

---

## Install Dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

---

## Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file in the project root.

```env
PORT=8001
GOOGLE_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY
CHROMA_HOST=localhost
CHROMA_PORT=8000
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash
```

---

## Run AI Service

```bash
npm run dev
```

---

## Install ChromaDB (if not installed)

```bash
pip install chromadb
```

If the `chroma` command is not recognized after installation, use the installed executable directly.

---

## Run ChromaDB

```powershell
& "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\Python\pythoncore-3.14-64\Scripts\chroma.exe"
```

When running successfully, Chroma will be available at:

```
http://localhost:8000
```

---

## API Endpoints

* `POST /api/parse`
* `POST /api/chat`
* `POST /api/summary`
* `POST /api/grammar`
* `POST /api/translate`
* `POST /api/ocr`

